    - lineId: false_front-debrief-01
      textKey: narrative.false_front.debrief.01
      englishFallback: All three vehicles reached shelter. The confirmed ambush is
        down, and the depot was never attacked. That distinction kept civilians alive.
      speaker: 1
      voiceClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 5dd1b7d1c8c8f486d98391975b4fce0a, type: 3}
