    - lineId: false_front-debrief-02
      textKey: narrative.false_front.debrief.02
      englishFallback: I preserved the false report. It traveled through a compromised
        Relay-era authority channel with a seal compatible with mine. I need to examine
        whether my missing archive made it.
      speaker: 3
      voiceClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 54044ec451d2c4d1ca33f810091b1458, type: 3}
